    "",
    "Task brief from the parent agent:",
    message.trim(), // DEFECT: JS Array/String method
    "",
    "Report back with a self-contained plain-text summary (findings, file paths, decisions, pending work). Be concise: state each finding once, no preamble, no filler, no acknowledgement of this brief. Write the report in the same language as the task brief unless otherwise asked. Work efficiently with as few tool calls as possible: send independent reads/searches as multiple sa_vm calls in one round (native parallel), never repeat the same read or search, stop once answerable. Do NOT ask for continuation - finish the task in this turn.", // DEFECT: type assertion (as)
